## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues
1. **"No unprocessed documents found"**:
   - Check if ETL collection has run recently
   - Verify `data/input/` contains markdown files
   - Review `processed_documents.json` tracking status

2. **"Ray actors failed to initialize"**:
   - Check Ray cluster status: `just ray-status`
   - Verify sufficient memory available
   - Review Ray dashboard at http://localhost:8265

3. **"Entity extraction failed"**:
   - Check OpenAI API key configuration
   - Verify Neo4j is running on port 7687
   - Check Graphiti service connectivity

4. **"Safety limit reached"**:
   - This is normal behavior to prevent overload
   - Run Flow 1B again to process next batch
   - Adjust FLOW1B_MAX_DOCUMENTS in .env if needed

